{"id":"msg_m_ex_trueflavor_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_trueflavor","label":"Nom Nom Nom · Group"},"label":"2. Bonne Bouche.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_trueflavor_01","next":"msg_m_ex_trueflavor_03","speakers":{"bready":"Bready"},"icons":{"bready":"si_c520_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"msg_m_ex_trueflavor_02_unlock","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"text":"Unlocks: Clear event stage 107410110 · After Nom Nom Nom chat 1. Bready has invited {AccountData.NickName} to j…","key":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_1","text":"Bonne Bouche.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_2","text":"Bonne Bouche!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_3","text":"Yes?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_4","text":"It seems Crust is finished with her research.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_5","text":"It would appear so, yeah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_6","text":"I received an invitation.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_7","text":"This is the first time she's done something like that.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_8","text":"What kind of research was she doing which warrants all this pomp and circumstance?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_9","text":"Ah.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_10","text":"Don't worry,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_11","text":"that was a rhetorical question.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_12","text":"I want to hear the answer from Crust herself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_13","text":"Ha, understandable.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_14","text":"So...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_15","text":"How does everything look to you, Bonne Bouche?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_16","text":"What do you mean?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_17","text":"I mean about Crust.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_18","text":"You saw the whole research process up close.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_19","text":"How did she look to you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_20","text":"I didn't get to see her at all, so I'm curious.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_21","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_21","text":"She looked tired.","jump":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_23"},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_22","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_22","text":"She looked happy.","jump":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_30"},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_23","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_24","text":"I see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_25","text":"That must have been hard for you to see.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_26","text":"I myself find it hard at times watching her work as hard as she does.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_27","text":"Running around doing everything,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_28","text":"all by herself.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_29","text":"It's doubly hard since I know there's nothing I can do to help.","jump":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_35"},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_30","text":"Oh,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_31","text":"well that's a small relief at least.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_32","text":"Whenever I tasted the food she's been making,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_33","text":"it seemed like things weren't going well, and I thought maybe she was having a hard time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_34","text":"But if she was happy during the process, then there's nothing to be worried about.","jump":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_35"},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_35","text":"Anyway,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_36","text":"I'm really looking forward to this.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_37","text":"You'll be there too, won't you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_38","text":"Yeah, I'll be there.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_39","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_40","text":"See you tomorrow then!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_trueflavor_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"bready","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_trueflavor_02_41","text":"Bye.","jump":null}],"chat":true}